WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Another one. This quarter it's called graph engineering.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Last month it was loops. Before that, harnesses. What actually changed?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
No clue. New name, so — more agents.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Hold on. Open just one of those. I can reason this out.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
What you feed it, how often you loop it, what you wire it to. All five books say that.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Hey — one more on top and—

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Look at this. Same diagram, both of them. All five were one book.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
So that's the whole field. Feed it well, loop it less, write it down.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
...So why was I up the ladder?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Names rotate every quarter. One page still runs in our own server room.

